## How it was measured

- **Engines:** {% for engine in engines %}[{{ engine.name }}]({{ engine.name }}/report.md){% if loop.revindex == 2 %} and {% elif not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}, one after another on the same GPU (driver {{ driver }}). Every engine received the same requests in the same order.
{{ common.method(workload, runs, resamples) }}
- **Change against the reference,** {{ reference | code }}: of the mean latency at the same concurrency, with a paired 95% interval, since every engine's bootstrap resamples draw the same requests.

Each engine's report adds how its GPU profiles were captured, its engine steps and its full setup.

